---
/**
 * Scheduling moved into the compose box on /messaging on 2026-09-17.
 *
 * It was a second form that asked the same four questions — who, what, and now
 * also when — and the only thing it added over the compose box was the "when".
 * So the "when" went onto the compose box and this screen stopped having a
 * reason to exist. The list of what is already scheduled is a fold at the
 * bottom of /messaging, which is where this link lands.
 *
 * 302 rather than 301, for the reason written out in pages/groups/index.astro:
 * a cached permanent redirect cannot be corrected from here.
 */
return Astro.redirect('/messaging?scheduled=open#scheduled', 302);
---
